WEBVTT

00:04:29.095 --> 00:04:30.996
what its destiny is?

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.017
Is that the right way to think about it?

00:04:33.041 --> 00:04:34.274
ML: Yes, quite.

00:04:34.298 --> 00:04:36.422
Basically, what happens
is that these cells,

00:04:36.446 --> 00:04:40.397
by forming electrical networks
much like networks in the brain,

00:04:40.421 --> 00:04:42.621
they form electrical networks,

00:04:42.645 --> 00:04:46.726
and these networks process information
including pattern memories.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:51.587
They include representation
of large-scale anatomical structures

00:04:51.611 --> 00:04:53.224
where various organs will go,

00:04:53.248 --> 00:04:56.920
what the different axes of the animal --
front and back, head and tail --

00:04:56.944 --> 00:04:58.102
are going to be,

00:04:58.126 --> 00:05:00.740
and these are literally
held in the electrical circuits